<p class="rounded-xl border border-teal-200 bg-teal-50 p-4 text-sm text-teal-950 dark:border-teal-900 dark:bg-teal-950 dark:text-teal-200">Paid revenue includes paid, non-cancelled orders only. Outstanding value includes unpaid, non-cancelled orders. Dates use order dates and current payment statuses, not actual payment receipt dates. Historical periods can change when orders are edited, paid, or cancelled.</p>
